      "spam": false,
      "value": "Gray is currently for muted people, though I can't see a difference in colors otherwise.  Is there actually a color difference?  As a colorblind person, I would like to have clearer color differences.  Green and Yellow, if those are the current two... I cannot tell those apart.  At least have the option to set the colors.\n\nI don't agree with Red, because red is a color that often gets associated as \"enemy\" or the like.  Perhaps a blue shade",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
