      "value": "@{59b9afc4e46c3651b53cf856|full_name}: The point is less friend or foe or creating distinctive colors as it is getting the user interface out of the way. When it was red, a dark red, the username interface blended into the background much better in pretty much all lighting conditions. Green is not one of those colors that hides.",
