      "value": "@{58c6da1b23f8d63e1401d381|full_name}: I understand the point that it is not the intent, but that is still just how a majority of people have associated colors.  Green and Blue are often seen as friendlies.  Red is a color symbol of anger.  Gray is a neutral color, and could work, but so is white.  \n\nHaving options to change colors would still be a nice feature though.  Let the players determine the colors people should be individually.",
