  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Can we go back to the color red for Friends and Gray for non-friends?\n\nGreen is a very sharp color for the UI and they continue to be glarinly obvious. When it was red, it was a still plenty visible, but it wasn't a distraction.\n\nAlso, an option button to remove names entirely so I don't have to keep CTRL + Ning.",
